      {
        "id": 163807,
        "name": "Nielzabub",
        "username": "Nielzabub",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/nielzabub/{size}/1986_2.png",
        "created_at": "2016-03-05T04:51:26.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Didn't get mint. I don't usually mind the Dreamer, but this game was not super fun. I hate Dark Hero. Dreamer has a lot of cards that hit multiple targets, and that plus one can add up really quickly. Having to deal with a second Dark Hero immediately after killing the first one was not enjoyable. Overall, I could see this one being manageable, but I took way too much damage early on.</p>",
