        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/w/b3f665/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2016-03-05T17:40:38.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I have played it both ways now. Once having Tachyon start by taking the Whipacorn damage and the second time having Chronoranger do it. Believe it or not, but that first decision seems to set you on very different paths. Won both ways, but it seemed like it was easier when I had CR take that first hit. Although it may have just been because I was more familiar with the setup.</p>",
