        "created_at": "2016-03-05T23:35:20.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Argh. My first Near Mint, because I miscalculated and left Char with too much HP before the Environment turn. The Treacherous Ape finished everyone off before I could even do anything on my turns.</p>",
