      {
        "id": 163810,
        "name": "Honolulu Blue",
        "username": "Honolulu_Blue",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/h/ecae2f/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2016-03-06T20:40:52.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I had to settle for Fine on this one.&nbsp; The first try was the first time I'd played The Dreamer, ever, and I was surprised at how much damage those projections did, and how much damage the Dark Hero soaked (ugh).&nbsp; One of the inmates blasted TLT for 11 damage - oops.&nbsp; I was maybe a turn away from clearing the board and winning, but I ran out of HP for everyone.&nbsp; The second try was worse as I had no answer for Char.&nbsp; The third try was the charm.&nbsp; I made all the right moves and had good cards.&nbsp; It still wasn't easy.</p>",
