        "created_at": "2016-03-07T11:33:48.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Finally got around to playing this one, got the mint, Omni went down because of a miscalculation on the Toy master (I let Omni time shift him into play thinking AZ could destroy him.)&nbsp;</p><p>Record : 10 mint, 1 near mint</p>",
