        "id": 163815,
        "name": "stevelabny",
        "username": "stevelabny",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/stevelabny/{size}/2536_2.png",
        "created_at": "2016-03-07T14:53:42.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I played Dreamer twice on my way to and from my SuperBowl viewing last mont and lost both times.</p><p>I've tried this one twice too. The first one was a disaster with me playing every incorrect card in round one (Why oh why doesn't the game remind you that you can't deal damage when its your turn?)&nbsp; The second one was going much better, but her flip is killer with the amount of projections/violent nightmares coming out. I still thought I was going to eke it out with Absolute Zero's incap side killing the environment deck but Tachyon went down too and with 6 buried projections and just one Tooth Fairy in play I had a chance... until I got visited by 3 or 4 more projections including a Whipacorn and Dark Hero and it finished off Omnitron and Chrono.</p><p>I think I'm letting the Toy Masters and her flip scare me from playing Omni and AZ's cards.&nbsp; Might try one more time before the week flips.</p>",
