      {
        "id": 163819,
        "name": "Bowie",
        "username": "Bowie",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/bowie/{size}/2097_2.png",
        "created_at": "2016-03-08T13:15:03.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Just uselessly chiming in after the fact:</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>The worst rating I have on any issue I competed in (I missed two weeks due to crazy life stuff) prior to this was two&nbsp;Near Mints-- one because I accidentally rewound to target someone else when I had misclicked, one because my client crashed which counted as an attempt. Every other was Mint. Those feel like they should've been Mints, too.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Yep, I earned this as a FINE. That was so brutal. Three tries.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Now to try the new one tonight, let's see if I can make Fine an one-off. Also seems brutal. Excited!</p>",
